					"nextDialogs": [
						752330307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「希顿」"
				},
				{
					"id": 752330307,
					"content": "果然，又在这个动作失败了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752330308
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 752330308,
					"content": "大、大师，请再给我一次机会…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752330309
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「希顿」"
				},
				{
					"id": 752330309,
					"content": "想要机会？声音再洪亮一点！你之前哭的气势去哪了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752330310
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「坎帕」"
				},
				{
					"id": 752330310,
					"content": "大、大师，请再给我一次机会！我想当皮皮潘偶像！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752330311
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「希顿」"
				},
				{
					"id": 752330311,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752330312
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「坎帕」"
				},
				{
					"id": 752330312,
					"content": "…好！很有气势！你合格了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752330313
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「坎帕」"
				},
				{
					"id": 752330313,
					"content": "这也算合格吗？！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752330314
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 752330314,
					"content": "当然合格！毅力比舞技重要多了！有了毅力，你就可以在一切强敌面前无所畏惧，在一切战场上都傲然屹立！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752330315
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「坎帕」"
				},
				{
					"id": 752330315,
					"content": "毅力，就是偶像的精神肌肉！你已经具备了基本的偶像之力。你，过关！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752330316
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「坎帕」"
				},
				{
					"id": 752330316,
					"content": "虽、虽然我有很多想说的话…但结果好，就是好吧…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
