			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 752331101,
					"content": "虽然「希顿」在舞台上表现出色，但遗憾的是，由于与其他选手实力相差悬殊，她最终与冠军失之交臂…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752331102
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 752331102,
					"content": "呜——又、又失败了，我连前三名都不是…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752331103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「希顿」"
				},
				{
					"id": 752331103,
					"content": "别、别灰心啦！最起码我们已经闯入了决赛啦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752331104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 752331104,
					"content": "我早就说过了，偶像之路可是很残酷的，它上面闪耀的不是光芒，是汗水！你的基本功明显还不够！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752331105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「坎帕」"
				},
				{
					"id": 752331105,
					"content": "这、这个声音是…？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752331106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 752331106,
					"content": "我、我…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752331107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「希顿」"
				},
				{
					"id": 752331107,
					"content": "不过，能走出第一步就是巨大的进步了。更何况你还坚持了两个回合，比我预想中的多多了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752331108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「坎帕」"
				},
				{
					"id": 752331108,
					"content": "老爹…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752331109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「希顿」"
				},
				{
					"id": 752331109,
					"content": "等一下，原来他就是你的老爹吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752331110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 752331110,
					"content": "哼，只不过有一点点进步而已，不代表你可以骄傲自满了！你的基本功太差了，不然也不会输得这么难看。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752331111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「坎帕」"
				},
				{
					"id": 752331111,
					"content": "现在就跟我回家，我要从零开始锻炼你！还有，现在我是你的老师，你该叫我大师才对！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752331112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「坎帕」"
				},
				{
					"id": 752331112,
					"content": "大师！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752331113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「希顿」"
				},
				{
					"id": 752331113,
					"content": "嗯，做好心理准备，战争可不会给你跪地求饶的机会！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752331114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「坎帕」"
				},
				{
					"id": 752331114,
					"content": "好的，大师！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752331115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「希顿」"
				},
				{
					"id": 752331115,
					"content": "所以，在你们的眼中，偶像到底是什么东西啊喂！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
